# The Android files of the modem chroot and the GPU's userspace (/opt/mu5358/android), relative to /: the closure
# measured on firmware B19 (modem/README.md, gpu/pull-gpu.sh). A file a firmware lacks is skipped; the installer adds
# dev/__properties__, system/bin/linker64, linkerconfig and vendor/lib64/libOpenCL.so itself.
